4042, "content": "", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": true, "comments": 17, "score_up": 232, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "\ud83e\udde0\u00a0\u00a0STABLE GENIUS\u00a0\u00a0\ud83e\udde0", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "text", "uuid": "1ATCIifvyH", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 27, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8781555, "raw_content": "Quit smoking and immediately started dreaming again, it's nightly now. Before they were rare, so I did some looking around.\n\n\"Chronic Marijuana Smoking, THC-Edible Use Impairs Endothelial Function, Similar With Tobacco\"\n\nEndothelial dysfunction occurs when there isn't enough nitric oxide inside of your blood vessel walls. Your endothelium will start making nitric oxide, which acts as a vasodilator, opening up your blood vessels for your blood to flow freely.\n\nThe result of this endothelial dysregulation is a cascade of harmful effects, including tightened blood vessels, small blood vessel leakage, blood clots, high levels of inflammation, and a disrupted immune response against viruses. \n\nThis is from a 3 year study.", "author": "PresidentAutopen", "created": 1786788350924, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "Givesgunstogrannies", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "How does THC affect blood circulation? ", "last_comment_created": 1786809430772, "content": "<p>Quit smoking and immediately started dreaming again, it's nightly now. Before they were rare, so I did some looking around.</p>\n<p>&quot;Chronic Marijuana Smoking, THC-Edible Use Impairs Endothelial Function, Similar With Tobacco&quot;</p>\n<p>Endothelial dysfunction occurs when there isn't enough nitric oxide inside of your blood vessel walls. Your endothelium will start making nitric oxide, which acts as a vasodilator, opening up your blood vessels for your blood to flow freely.</p>\n<p>The result of this endothelial dysregulation is a cascade of harmful effects, including tightened blood vessels, small blood vessel leakage, blood clots, high levels of inflammation, and a disrupted immune response against viruses.</p>\n<p>This is from a 3 year study.</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 15, "score_up": 27, "is_edited": true, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "2088642893271421159", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1ATCIih1tu", "is_twitter": true, "is_admin": false, "score": 10, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "maga", "id": 8781916, "raw_content": "", "author": "journalist", "created": 1786807766576, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "twitter.com", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "https://media.scored.co/preview/1ATCIih1tu.png", "removal_source": "", "link": "https://twitter.com/TRobinsonNewEra/status/2088642893271421159?s=20", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "Invaders in Ceuta boast about raping girls in the forest there.", "last_comment_created": 1786807766576, "content": "", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_t